		{"id":"1fcd1745eec3a34e","type":"text","text":"#9 · Cut the third-party critical path (M)\nPlex CSS is render-blocking and cross-origin, then the woff2 — two RTTs before FCP, which delays the CSS intro start. Self-host Plex woff2 + `preload`, or `display=optional` for first landing.","x":340,"y":200,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"96d8a85acbcdb7a9","type":"text","text":"📍`bundle.js` (264 KB) — `modulepreload` is **build-only**; in dev the fetch starts at the body-end `import()` (measured: same ms as DCL). Never evaluated before DCL either way","x":-240,"y":610,"width":400,"height":160,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"8d203850a442fe8f","type":"text","text":"📍`Preloader.js` module graph — head `<script type=module>`: `Preloader.js` → lumberjack, events, SessionManager (→ lumberjack), constants, deferred-videos. 2 serial import round trips, none `modulepreload`ed","x":-240,"y":1140,"width":400,"height":180,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"5909398acbe206f5","type":"text","text":"#8 · Flatten the Preloader module graph (S)\nTwo serial import round trips before `initPreloader` can run. `modulepreload` the five imports in `head.njk`, or bundle `Preloader.js` the way the choreography bundle is.","x":340,"y":1165,"width":420,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"378eb420668f4660","x":300,"y":-780,"width":480,"height":310,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"## Page rendering blocked until styles.css loads\nLanding view for the page is pure CSS. hanko.css runs S00→S03 from first paint; Preloader.js only decides when to flip exit. If the sheet lands after first paint, the user sees raw [data-preloader] markup (unstyled SVG + two `<p>`'s in flow) then a snap into the intro. Blocking CSS is the FOUC guard the preloader strategy depends on.\n\n Also, Tailwind has no natural above/below-fold seam. Every above-fold element is atomic class=\"\" scattered through the sheet."}
	],
